From: Comzee <117947104+Comzee@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: panel: describe the RK3128 reference board assembly

The shipped Rockchip 3.10 kernel drives GPIO0_A2 high, delays 10 ms,
drives GPIO0_B4 low and delays 10 ms. Disable inverts the two outputs in
the same order without delays. Both lines are active low in gpiod terms.
Request ASIS so the bootloader's lit picture survives probe; prepare sets
output directions and the active levels without a reset pulse. A dedicated
panel driver keeps the generic panel-lvds behaviour unchanged.

Reference: rk_disp_pwr_enable (0xc02fe508) and rk_disp_pwr_disable
(0xc02fe630), shipped Image sha256
01a2967904b975307884092778f313213a6de2ef2ecc841233ae5c4fe2a24729.
Readable BSP: rockchip-linux/kernel
89a3df543d5d6936eaf2b193316a38fecc94a1e4,
drivers/video/rockchip/rk_fb.c. Board wiring/order: vendor DT power_ctr.

Signed-off-by: Comzee <117947104+Comzee@users.noreply.github.com>
---

--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/panel/rockchip,rk3128-reference-panel.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,45 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+%YAML 1.2
+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/display/panel/rockchip,rk3128-reference-panel.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+title: RK3128 reference board LVDS panel assembly
+
+maintainers:
+  - Comzee <reference@example.invalid>
+
+description: |
+  The RK3128 reference board board drives a 1920x1080 LVDS panel assembly, including its bridge.
+  Reset and enable are active low. The vendor sequence deasserts reset, waits
+  10 ms, asserts enable, then waits 10 ms. Disable asserts reset before
+  deasserting enable, without delays. Acquiring the lines must preserve their
+  state for the already-lit bootloader handover; enable never pulses reset.
+
+allOf:
+  - $ref: panel-common.yaml#
+  - $ref: /schemas/display/lvds.yaml#
+
+properties:
+  compatible:
+    const: rockchip,rk3128-reference-panel
+  reset-gpios:
+    maxItems: 1
+  enable-gpios:
+    maxItems: 1
+  data-mapping:
+    const: vesa-24
+
+required:
+  - compatible
+  - reset-gpios
+  - enable-gpios
+  - backlight
+  - data-mapping
+  - width-mm
+  - height-mm
+  - panel-timing
+  - port
+
+unevaluatedProperties: false
+...
